flowchart TD
    O[Owner Authority] <--> R[Stateful Bearing Lite Planning Orchestrator]
    R --> P{Next missing planning stage?}
    P -->|Intake| IN[Intake in controller]
    P -->|Architectural Alignment and Scope| AA[Combined alignment and scope in controller]
    IN & AA -->|recorded context and decisions| R
    P -->|enabled and needed specialists, data-dependency order| RE[Requirements Engineer authors and self-checks]
    RE -->|requirements| SM[Systems Modeler placement receipt]
    RE & SM -->|requirements and models| IEP[Integration Engineer planning boundary contract]
    RE & IEP -->|requirements and interfaces| TEP[Planning Test Engineer SEIT bound to requirement IDs]
    RE & SM & IEP & TEP -->|completed inputs; inactive roles skipped| PD[Orchestrator final Planning and Design and assembly in controller]
    PD -->|only when owner requested| PR[Requested planning review]
    PD -->|review not requested: recorded| I{Owner confirmation}
    PR --> I
    I -->|change| PD
    I -->|confirmed| H[handoff.md; recommend new Implementation Orchestrator session]
    H --> X[Implementation Orchestrator consumes handoff]
    X -->|tdd| TI[Test Implementer writes failing tests first]
    TI --> C[Product Implementer may continue in-wave]
    X -->|single_implementer| C
    X -->|approve one wave| E[Coordinator may continue in-wave]
    E --> C
    C --> A{Declared phase or wave end candidate?}
    A -->|Assurance Test Engineer requested| V[Fresh Assurance Test Engineer]
    A -->|Reviewer requested| PK[Fresh Reviewer]
    A -->|Integration Engineer execution requested| S[Fresh Integration Engineer execution]
    A -->|direct packet not yet| C
    A -->|coordinator wave not yet| E
    V & PK & S -->|compact receipt| X
